  "identity": {
    "playing_style": "Knutsen's Bodø/Glimt have played the same relational 4-3-3 since 2018: high defensive line, counter-pressing, short passing through the thirds and overloads around the wingers and attacking full-backs. The artificial pitch and Arctic conditions at Aspmyra are a deliberate home advantage. In 2025/26 they beat Atlético away, knocked out Inter 5-2 on aggregate in the knockout play-off and led Sporting 3-0 before losing 3-5 on aggregate in the round of 16. In August 2026 qualifying the XI was Haikin; Sjøvold, Bjørtuft, Aleesami, Bjørkan; Auklend, Berg, Fet; Blomberg, Helmersen, Hauge - with 80% possession and 21-3 shots in the 3-0 over NEC.",
